      "value": "I’ve reported an external interface issue and I think it has the same root cause. \n\nI wish the devs will merge it or track this one instead since it’s describing the issue better. \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/ios-mobile-beta/p/external-audio-interface-not-working",
